# Cloud Run Mapping

The current pipeline uses Docker Hub and Docker Compose for the local
deployment stage. The equivalent Google Cloud Run pipeline would map
the stages as follows:

| Current Pipeline | Cloud Run Equivalent |
|---|---|
| GitHub Actions | GitHub Actions |
| Docker Hub | Google Artifact Registry |
| `docker build` | `docker build` |
| `docker push` | `docker push` to Artifact Registry |
| Docker Hub authentication | Google Cloud service account authentication |
| `docker compose up -d` | `gcloud run deploy` |
| Local container runtime | Google Cloud Run |

## Pipeline Flow

```text
git push
   ↓
GitHub Actions
   ↓
Build Docker image
   ↓
Authenticate using Google Cloud service account
   ↓
Push image to Artifact Registry
   ↓
gcloud run deploy
   ↓
Cloud Run service
